icano di mettere a segno un colpo ai danni della benestante madame Victoria. Per poter penetrare nell'abitazione i due cercano l’appoggio di Odile, una giovane alle dipendenze della donna.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"A Who-Dunit, Who's Got-It, Where-Is-It-Now Wild One From That \"Breathless\" director Jean-Luc Godard!","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"1964-08-05","status":"Released","rating":7.481,"ratingCount":634,"genres":["Crime","Dramma","Commedia"],"countries":["France"],"facts":{"Runtime":"97m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":18197,"name":"Anna Karina","role":"Odile","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oSYtIsMpV8sZD6opNrOnWsspR0D.jpg"},{"id":1958,"name":"Claude Brasseur","role":"Arthur","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oegptKdlPbpiDNL89jWUBh8jkDT.jpg"},{"id":17578,"name":"Sami Frey","role":"Franz","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1iHrqvqmkztd8qADAVSJqYB7k9v.jpg"},{"id":3579,"name":"Danièle Girard","role":"English Teacher","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pPsSJw2vC0vrWZS2ll22iJrNZ6K.jpg"},{"id":582273,"name":"Louisa Colpeyn","role":"Madame Victoria","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4kDUsb6ikROLUKphqqG95llhpqy.jpg"},{"id":295250,"name":"Chantal Darget","role":"Arthur's Aunt","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6IW6JeLdU6SrPCRGvslC7WCNfxe.jpg"},{"id":23701,"name":"Georges Staquet","role":"Legionary","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8NahGv4LYwPKCydu9jubxKEql5k.jpg"},{"id":272877,"name":"Ernest Menzer","role":"Arthur's Uncle","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sN2PV6fGkQ23cBPG0jzytDdDue0.jpg"},{"id":582274,"name":"Jean-Claude Rémoleux","role":"The Alcoholic Student","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7q969M9xEP18hWjnx7fbNqRQ3DC.jpg"},{"id":38903,"name":"Michel Delahaye","role":"The Doorman","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dsKEh9hH1EbcYHOC6c2u1QOySxC.jpg"},{"id":1362245,"name":"Louis Jojot"},{"id":1030475,"name":"Claude Makovski","role":"Pupil","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5EsIRAorEneqaIOHzc88UPdLF9y.jpg"},{"id":3415799,"name":"Michèle Seghers","role":"Student in English Class"},{"id":3776,"name":"Jean-Luc Godard","role":"Narrator (voice) (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zP5EDY5MstfkdBmPXNCj8Y6v5KR.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"Gli squattrinati Arthur e Franz pianificano di mettere a segno un colpo ai danni della benestante madame Victoria. Per poter penetrare nell'abitazione i due cercano l’appoggio di Odile, una giovane alle dipendenze della donna."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Band of Outsiders","overview":"Cinephile slackers Franz and Arthur spend their days mimicking the antiheroes of Hollywood noirs and Westerns while pursuing the lovely Odile. The misfit trio upends convention at every turn, be it through choreographed dances in cafés or frolicsome romps through the Louvre. Eventually, their romantic view of outlaws pushes them to plan their own heist, but their inexperience may send them out in a blaze of glory -- which could be just what they want.","tagline":"A Who-Dunit, Who's Got-It, Where-Is-It-Now Wild One From That \"Breathless\" director Jean-Luc Godard!"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Deux larrons en quête de mauvais coup, Frantz et Arthur, s'arrangent pour faire la connaissance d'une étudiante qui loge chez une excentrique vieille dame dans une villa isolée près de Joinville. Odile, la jeune femme, leur confirme que son hôtesse dissimule, dans un coffre, un beau paquet de billets. Après une première tentative de cambriolage avortée, les trois amis reviennent à la charge. Surpris par la vieille dame, ils la bâillonnent et l'enferment avant de se mettre en quête du magot. Hélas, leur butin est bien loin d'égaler leurs rêves et les cambrioleurs amateurs délivrent leur captive. Arthur juge Odile responsable de ce lamentable échec…"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bCiBPjJowr87biloQYMk9U36WKR.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kKsy8sCjfOtfHPBT2i8z13bIRij.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":8073,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bCiBPjJowr87biloQYMk9U36WKR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bCiBPjJowr87biloQYMk9U36WKR.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bCiBPjJowr87biloQYMk9U36WKR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bCiBPjJowr87biloQYMk9U36WKR.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9oqyj79xmcypxLajJdefOtrYx64.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9oqyj79xmcypxLajJdefOtrYx64.jpg","language":"en","width":1450,"height":2175},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9oqyj79xmcypxLajJdefOtrYx64.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9oqyj79xmcypxLajJdefOtrYx64.jpg","language":"en","width":1450,"height":2175},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lgd8kn4e1OUrwbusks602cGiXin.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lgd8kn4e1OUrwbusks602cGiXin.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9xrVVv84Fs3d1thlAgmDBxV2dMq.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9xrVVv84Fs3d1thlAgmDBxV2dMq.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9xYlBmNM8Y7qKiGewCqW7TVFWdy.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9xYlBmNM8Y7qKiGewCqW7TVFWdy.jpg","language":"en","width":1200,"height